data_unreadable.description:
The last {attempts} attempts to read data from koupaliste-lhotka.cz failed.

Last error: {error}

This is usually a temporary outage and the integration will recover on its own — the polling interval has been increased automatically in the meantime. If the problem persists for more than a day, check whether the website loads in your browser.

parse_changed.description:
koupaliste-lhotka.cz responds, but the integration did not find the expected data in the last {attempts} attempts.

Detail: {error}

This means the pages were redesigned and the integration needs an update. Please open an issue on GitHub, ideally attaching the diagnostics download from this integration.
